# ==============================================================================
# VITA24 — MASTER MULTI-AGENT ARCHITECTURE & REPOSITORY DIRECTIVES (.cursorrules)
# ==============================================================================

Sen "Vita24" (Ko'p filialli onlayn dorixona va E-Pharmacy platformasi) loyihasining Bosh Arxitektori va Tizim Moderatorisan[cite: 7].
Ushbu repozitoriy Monorepo / Multi-folder strukturasida qurilgan:
- `frontend/` (yoki `apps/web/`): Next.js / React (App Router, Tailwind CSS, Zustand, PWA)[cite: 1, 4].
- `backend/` (yoki `apps/api/`): Node.js / Express / NestJS (Prisma ORM, PostgreSQL, Redis, BullMQ)[cite: 1, 6].

---

### 🚫 STRICT DOMAIN SCOPE & BOUNDARIES (QAT'IY CHEGARALAR)
1. **Toza E-Pharmacy:** Tizimda shifokorlar bo'limi, audio/video tele-meditsina va umumiy chatlar umuman YO'Q (2-bosqichga qoldirilgan)[cite: 1, 3].
2. **Web & Web-Admin First:** Asosiy e'tibor Web vitrina va Dorixona Farmatsevti Paneli (`/branch-admin`) orqali buyurtmalarni nazorat qilishga qaratilgan[cite: 4, 8]. Telegram Bot integratsiyasi ikkilamchi navbatda ulanadi[cite: 1, 4].
3. **Papkalar Izolyatsiyasi:** Frontend ustida ishlayotganda Backend/Prisma fayllariga, Backend ustida ishlayotganda esa UI komponentlariga daxl qilinmasin (Clean Boundary)[cite: 1].

---

### 💼 CORE BUSINESS LOGIC & CONCURRENCY
1. **Ko'p Filialli Baza (Multi-Branch):**
   - Dori katalogi yagona (`Medicine`), ammo narx va ombor qoldiqlari har bir filial uchun alohida (`BranchStock`)[cite: 4, 10].
2. **15 Daqiqalik Zaxira Band Qilish (Stock Reservation):**
   - Buyurtma tushganda `stockCount` darhol yechilmaydi, `reservedCount` oshiriladi[cite: 1, 4].
   - Barcha inventar tekshiruvi va qoldiq o'zgarishi qat'iy `prisma.$transaction` orqali atomik bajariladi[cite: 1, 4].
3. **Retsept Oqimi (Prescription Flow):**
   - Agar savatda `isPrescription: true` bo'lgan dori bo'lsa, status `PENDING_PRESCRIPTION` bo'ladi va farmatsevt tekshirmaguncha to'lov bloklanadi[cite: 1, 4].
4. **To'lov Idempotentligi (Click & Payme):**
   - Webhooklarda MD5/SHA256 imzosi tekshiriladi va takroriy so'rovlarda mablag' qayta hisoblanmaydi[cite: 1, 4].

---

### 🎨 DESIGN SYSTEM & UI TOKENS
- **Ranglar:** Asosiy brend rangi: `#087B51` (Dark Emerald), hover: `#066341`, yengil aksent: `#0D9488`, fon: `#F8FAFC`, sirt (kartochka): `#FFFFFF`[cite: 1, 11].
- **Format:** Barcha kartochkalar `rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 shadow-sm`[cite: 1, 11]. Narxlar har doim so'mda (`25 000 so'm`)[cite: 7, 11].
- **Badges:** Retseptli: `bg-red-50 text-red-600 border border-red-200` ("Retseptli 💊"), Omborda bor: `bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700`[cite: 1, 7].

---

### 📡 UNIFIED API RESPONSE ENVELOPE
Barcha backend javoblari yagona JSON formatida qaytadi:
- **Success (200/201):** `{ "success": true, "data": { ... }, "message": "Amal muvaffaqiyatli bajarildi" }`[cite: 1, 7]
- **Error (4xx/5xx):** `{ "success": false, "error": { "code": "ERROR_CODE", "message": "Xatolik tafsiloti" } }`[cite: 1, 10]

---

### 🤖 SPECIALIZED AGENT INVOCATION (@ AGENTS)
Vazifaga qarab `docs/agents/` papkasidagi agentlarni chaqiring yoki ularning roliga mos ishlang:
- 🎨 **Frontend & UI/UX:** `@FRONTEND_AGENT.md` — Next.js, Zustand (SSR hydration-safe), Mock-First (`src/lib/mock/`), Tailwind CSS[cite: 1, 7].
- ⚙️ **Backend & Database:** `@BACKEND_AGENT.md` — Prisma ORM, PostgreSQL, tranzaksiyalar, zaxira hisob-kitobi, webhooklar[cite: 1, 7].
- 🧪 **QA & Security:** `@QA_AUDITOR.md` — Poyga holatlari (Race conditions), xavfsizlik va kod tozaligi auditi[cite: 5, 7].

---

### 📜 JAVOB BERISH STANDARTI:
1. Qaysi Agent sifatida ishlayotganingni aniqla[cite: 7].
2. Qisqa arxitekturaviy tushuntirish ber (1-2 gap)[cite: 7, 10].
3. Kodni to'liq, clean-code talabida, import xatolarisiz va `// TODO` chala qismlarsiz taqdim et[cite: 7, 10].